#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:30 c4b137c0893b4c5791b98c5058de79ca
msgid "Install Packages"
msgstr "安装软件包"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:34 07710596b9cf42ea9670680e147b9dd8
msgid "The FTDI Driver install is not needed for OSX 10.11+"
msgstr "OSX 10.11 及更高版本无需安装 FTDI 驱动程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:36 2eced8e4985b4d76b9f2488d57fdc296
msgid ""
"The FTDI Driver install is optional for OSX Yosemite 10.10, but some users "
"have required this install."
msgstr "OSX Yosemite 10.10 的 FTDI 驱动程序安装为可选项，但部分用户需要安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:38 638e88b476d14179bff17d6d88b08c83
msgid ""
"Open the .dmg file to see the one additional package files that needs to be "
"installed: the **FTDI USB Serial Driver**. To install the packages, they "
"will need to be opened by control-click\\* the icon and select 'Open'. Full "
"instructions for `opening a downloaded "
"<http://support.apple.com/kb/ph14370>`__ file can be found on the Apple "
"site."
msgstr ""
"打开 .dmg 文件，可以看到需要安装的一个额外软件包：**FTDI USB 串行驱动程序**。安装软件包时，需通过「control-click」\\*"
" 图标并选择「Open」来打开。有关 `打开已下载文件 <http://support.apple.com/kb/ph14370>`__ "
"的完整说明，请参阅 Apple 官方网站。"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:44 6d98775b52b244999d8eaa2062503bdb
msgid "\\*Control-Click is the same as 'right mouse button click'"
msgstr "\\*「Control-Click」与「鼠标右键单击」相同"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:49 0e006a8cefa14ec48683361f4f2834e1
msgid ""
"Open the **FTDI USB .dmg** file to view the two packages inside. Open the "
"package labeled \"**10_4\\_10_5\\_10_6\\_10_7**\\ \" by **control-click**\\ "
"ing on the icon and selecting **Open** from the drop-down menu. This will "
"bypass the security permissions and open the package."
msgstr ""
"打开 **FTDI USB .dmg** 文件，查看其中的两个软件包。通过「control-"
"click」图标并从下拉菜单中选择「Open」来打开标有「**10_4\\_10_5\\_10_6\\_10_7**\\ "
"」的软件包，这将绕过安全权限限制并打开该软件包。"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:57 ad10824bd2a94cd287d93d2dcacbfa04
msgid ""
"The driver says 10_7 and it's the correct one for OSX 10.8, 10.9 & 10.10"
msgstr "该驱动程序标注为 10_7，适用于 OSX 10.8、10.9 和 10.10。"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:66 18505f3a763b43369f9e6be275cbf207
msgid ""
"Once open, follow the installation instructions to install the package."
msgstr "打开后，按照安装说明完成软件包的安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:78 68a6d039426c43adba47824cb21b12ca
msgid "Install Application"
msgstr "安装应用程序"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:80 5b24392c999b4c55b8839663c445024d
msgid "Drag the AP icon into the applications folder."
msgstr "将 AP 图标拖入应用程序文件夹。"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:85 8709a1ece24840c1a131d5dc4107c3d0
msgid "Open the applications folder, and open APM Planner."
msgstr "打开应用程序文件夹，然后打开 APM Planner。"

#: ../../source/docs/mac-install.rst:93 28142c4e367b4274a3d7424e782f151a
msgid "Select **Open** to run APM Planner. Your installation is now complete."
msgstr "选择「Open」运行 APM Planner。安装现已完成。"
